scan47; Proposition10.2 p.158 scan173"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(2).zip修订；既有原书定位、日期和过往核对叙述作为继承记录，未重新取得或查看原书原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"声明、类型、绑定、递归及书内链接审查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BVar}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BVar}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i=p_j\\leftrightarrow i=j\">\\(p_i=p_j\\leftrightarrow i=j\\)</span>；它们是互异布尔变量符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b9525166bc5de094\" href=\"?note=b9525166bc5de094\" title=\"29-df-bool-const\">29-df-bool-const</a>。所有公式构造子具有不同语法标签。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathrm{BVar}\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(b:\\mathrm{BVar}\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in\\mathrm{BVar}\">\\(p,q\\in\\mathrm{BVar}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathbb B\">\\(a\\in\\mathbb B\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b[a/p]\">\\(b[a/p]\\)</span> 的实际函数值在下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{BFml}\">\\(\\phi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{BFml}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QBF}\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QBF}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j,r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i,j,r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span> 为空序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vert\">\\(\\Vert\\)</span> 为串接。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar\\chi\\in\\mathrm{BFml}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\bar\\chi\\in\\mathrm{BFml}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；公式折叠函数的输入是有限公式序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar q\\in(\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\times\\mathrm{BVar})^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\bar q\\in(\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\times\\mathrm{BVar})^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。非空前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar q=(q_0,\\ldots,q_{r-1})\">\\(\\bar q=(q_0,\\ldots,q_{r-1})\\)</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_i=(Q_i,p_{j_i})\">\\(q_i=(Q_i,p_{j_i})\\)</span> 表示其分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreQBF}\">\\(\\mathrm{PreQBF}\\)</span> 的前缀变量互异并覆盖矩阵全部变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1dacc2eff0f3c359\" href=\"?note=1dacc2eff0f3c359\" title=\"29-df-turing-machine\">29-df-turing-machine</a> 的自然数二进制串函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathtt{0},\\mathtt{1},\\mathtt{000},\\ldots,\\mathtt{111}\">\\(\\mathtt{0},\\mathtt{1},\\mathtt{000},\\ldots,\\mathtt{111}\\)</span> 是所显示的有限比特串，不是自然数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_B\">\\(\\operatorname{code}_B\\)</span> 的标签长度均为三位。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\psi\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\psi\\rangle\\)</span> 仅为下式编码函数的别名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_q=\\langle P^{(2)},N^{(2)},U^{(1)}\\rangle\">\\(\\tau_q=\\langle P^{(2)},N^{(2)},U^{(1)}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_q]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_q]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq2\">\\(n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\([n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;^A\">\\(&lt;^A\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4563061cac782dab\" href=\"?note=4563061cac782dab\" title=\"29-df-standard-inputs\">29-df-standard-inputs</a> 的标准序，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_A\">\\(e_A\\)</span> 是下式唯一确定的递增枚举。每个元素同时索引一个变量和一个子句；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 标记全称变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,N\">\\(P,N\\)</span> 标记子句中的正负出现。</li>\n<li>序列推导式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle t_i\\mid i&lt;n,\\ P(i)\\rangle\">\\(\\langle t_i\\mid i&lt;n,\\ P(i)\\rangle\\)</span> 保留满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(i)\">\\(P(i)\\)</span> 的下标并按自然数递增排列；所有合取、析取及量词前缀由本条递归折叠函数构造，不对无序集合直接选择括号或顺序。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BVar}\\cup\\{\\bot,\\top\\},\\qquad\\mathcal B_{j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal B_j\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\chi,\\phi\\lor\\chi\\mid\\phi,\\chi\\in\\mathcal B_j\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{BFml}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal B_j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal B_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BVar}\\cup\\{\\bot,\\top\\},\\qquad\\mathcal B_{j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal B_j\\cup\\{\\neg\\phi,\\phi\\land\\chi,\\phi\\lor\\chi\\mid\\phi,\\chi\\in\\mathcal B_j\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{BFml}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal B_j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BFml},\\qquad\\mathcal Q_{j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal Q_j\\cup\\{Qp\\,\\psi\\mid Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\},\\ p\\in\\mathrm{BVar},\\ \\psi\\in\\mathcal Q_j\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{QBF}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal Q_j.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal Q_0\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BFml},\\qquad\\mathcal Q_{j+1}\\coloneqq\\mathcal Q_j\\cup\\{Qp\\,\\psi\\mid Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\},\\ p\\in\\mathrm{BVar},\\ \\psi\\in\\mathcal Q_j\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{QBF}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal Q_j.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}(p)\\coloneqq\\{p\\},\\quad\\operatorname{Var}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Var}(\\top)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{Var}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Var}(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{Var}(\\phi\\circ\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Var}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{Var}(\\chi),\\quad\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Var}(p)\\coloneqq\\{p\\},\\quad\\operatorname{Var}(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Var}(\\top)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\\operatorname{Var}(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Var}(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{Var}(\\phi\\circ\\chi)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Var}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{Var}(\\chi),\\quad\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b[a/p](q)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;q=p,\\\\b(q),&amp;q\\ne p.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b[a/p](q)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}a,&amp;q=p,\\\\b(q),&amp;q\\ne p.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_b:\\mathrm{QBF}\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad\\operatorname{val}_b(\\bot)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{val}_b(\\top)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\operatorname{val}_b(p)\\coloneqq b(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_b:\\mathrm{QBF}\\to\\mathbb B,\\qquad\\operatorname{val}_b(\\bot)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\\operatorname{val}_b(\\top)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\operatorname{val}_b(p)\\coloneqq b(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_b(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq1-\\operatorname{val}_b(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_b(\\phi\\land\\chi)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{val}_b(\\phi),\\operatorname{val}_b(\\chi)\\},\\quad\\operatorname{val}_b(\\phi\\lor\\chi)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{val}_b(\\phi),\\operatorname{val}_b(\\chi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_b(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq1-\\operatorname{val}_b(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{val}_b(\\phi\\land\\chi)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\operatorname{val}_b(\\phi),\\operatorname{val}_b(\\chi)\\},\\quad\\operatorname{val}_b(\\phi\\lor\\chi)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\operatorname{val}_b(\\phi),\\operatorname{val}_b(\\chi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{val}_b(\\exists p\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B}\\operatorname{val}_{b[a/p]}(\\psi),\\qquad\\operatorname{val}_b(\\forall p\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B}\\operatorname{val}_{b[a/p]}(\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{val}_b(\\exists p\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\max_{a\\in\\mathbb B}\\operatorname{val}_{b[a/p]}(\\psi),\\qquad\\operatorname{val}_b(\\forall p\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\min_{a\\in\\mathbb B}\\operatorname{val}_{b[a/p]}(\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{And}_B(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Or}_B(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{And}_B(\\langle\\phi\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\chi)\\coloneqq\\phi\\land\\operatorname{And}_B(\\bar\\chi),\\quad\\operatorname{Or}_B(\\langle\\phi\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\chi)\\coloneqq\\phi\\lor\\operatorname{Or}_B(\\bar\\chi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{And}_B(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\top,\\quad\\operatorname{Or}_B(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{And}_B(\\langle\\phi\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\chi)\\coloneqq\\phi\\land\\operatorname{And}_B(\\bar\\chi),\\quad\\operatorname{Or}_B(\\langle\\phi\\rangle\\Vert\\bar\\chi)\\coloneqq\\phi\\lor\\operatorname{Or}_B(\\bar\\chi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pfx}_B(\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\operatorname{Pfx}_B(\\langle(Q,p)\\rangle\\Vert\\bar q,\\phi)\\coloneqq Qp\\,\\operatorname{Pfx}_B(\\bar q,\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pfx}_B(\\langle\\rangle,\\phi)\\coloneqq\\phi,\\qquad\\operatorname{Pfx}_B(\\langle(Q,p)\\rangle\\Vert\\bar q,\\phi)\\coloneqq Qp\\,\\operatorname{Pfx}_B(\\bar q,\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PreQBF}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{Pfx}_B(\\langle(Q_i,p_{j_i})\\rangle_{i&lt;r},\\phi)\\ \\middle|\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\phi\\in\\mathrm{BFml},\\ (Q_i)_{i&lt;r}\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}^r,\\ (j_i)_{i&lt;r}\\in\\mathbb N^r,\\ |\\{j_i:i&lt;r\\}|=r,\\ \\operatorname{Var}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{p_{j_i}:i&lt;r\\}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PreQBF}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\operatorname{Pfx}_B(\\langle(Q_i,p_{j_i})\\rangle_{i&lt;r},\\phi)\\ \\middle|\\ r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\phi\\in\\mathrm{BFml},\\ (Q_i)_{i&lt;r}\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}^r,\\ (j_i)_{i&lt;r}\\in\\mathbb N^r,\\ |\\{j_i:i&lt;r\\}|=r,\\ \\operatorname{Var}(\\phi)\\subseteq\\{p_{j_i}:i&lt;r\\}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ncode}_B(i)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{1}^{|\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(i)|}\\Vert\\mathtt{0}\\Vert\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ncode}_B(i)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{1}^{|\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(i)|}\\Vert\\mathtt{0}\\Vert\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}(i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_B(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{000},\\quad\\operatorname{code}_B(\\top)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{001},\\quad\\operatorname{code}_B(p_i)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{010}\\Vert\\operatorname{ncode}_B(i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{code}_B(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{000},\\quad\\operatorname{code}_B(\\top)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{001},\\quad\\operatorname{code}_B(p_i)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{010}\\Vert\\operatorname{ncode}_B(i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_B(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{011}\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{code}_B(\\phi\\land\\chi)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{100}\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\phi)\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\chi),\\quad\\operatorname{code}_B(\\phi\\lor\\chi)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{101}\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\phi)\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\chi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{code}_B(\\neg\\phi)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{011}\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\phi),\\quad\\operatorname{code}_B(\\phi\\land\\chi)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{100}\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\phi)\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\chi),\\quad\\operatorname{code}_B(\\phi\\lor\\chi)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{101}\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\phi)\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\chi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_B(\\exists p_i\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{110}\\Vert\\operatorname{ncode}_B(i)\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\psi),\\qquad\\operatorname{code}_B(\\forall p_i\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{111}\\Vert\\operatorname{ncode}_B(i)\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{code}_B(\\exists p_i\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{110}\\Vert\\operatorname{ncode}_B(i)\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\psi),\\qquad\\operatorname{code}_B(\\forall p_i\\,\\psi)\\coloneqq\\mathtt{111}\\Vert\\operatorname{ncode}_B(i)\\Vert\\operatorname{code}_B(\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}_B:\\mathrm{QBF}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad\\langle\\psi\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}_B(\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{code}_B:\\mathrm{QBF}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb B^*,\\qquad\\langle\\psi\\rangle\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}_B(\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QSAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\Psi\\rangle\\mid\\Psi\\in\\mathrm{PreQBF},\\ \\forall b\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathrm{BVar}}\\;\\operatorname{val}_b(\\Psi)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QSAT}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\Psi\\rangle\\mid\\Psi\\in\\mathrm{PreQBF},\\ \\forall b\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathrm{BVar}}\\;\\operatorname{val}_b(\\Psi)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_A\\coloneqq\\iota e:[n]\\mathrel{\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}}|A|\\;\\forall i,j&lt;n\\;(i&lt;j\\leftrightarrow(e(i),e(j))\\in&lt;^A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_A\\coloneqq\\iota e:[n]\\mathrel{\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}}|A|\\;\\forall i,j&lt;n\\;(i&lt;j\\leftrightarrow(e(i),e(j))\\in&lt;^A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q_i^A\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\forall,&amp;e_A(i)\\in U^A,\\\\\\exists,&amp;e_A(i)\\notin U^A,\\end{cases}\\qquad i&lt;n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q_i^A\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\forall,&amp;e_A(i)\\in U^A,\\\\\\exists,&amp;e_A(i)\\notin U^A,\\end{cases}\\qquad i&lt;n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\phi_A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{And}_B\\left(\\left\\langle\\operatorname{Or}_B\\bigl(\\langle p_i\\mid i&lt;n,\\ (e_A(j),e_A(i))\\in P^A\\rangle\\bigr)\\lor\\operatorname{Or}_B\\bigl(\\langle\\neg p_i\\mid i&lt;n,\\ (e_A(j),e_A(i))\\in N^A\\rangle\\bigr)\\right\\rangle_{j&lt;n}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\phi_A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{And}_B\\left(\\left\\langle\\operatorname{Or}_B\\bigl(\\langle p_i\\mid i&lt;n,\\ (e_A(j),e_A(i))\\in P^A\\rangle\\bigr)\\lor\\operatorname{Or}_B\\bigl(\\langle\\neg p_i\\mid i&lt;n,\\ (e_A(j),e_A(i))\\in N^A\\rangle\\bigr)\\right\\rangle_{j&lt;n}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Psi_A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pfx}_B(\\langle(Q_i^A,p_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;n},\\phi_A),\\qquad\\mathrm{QSAT}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_q]\\mid\\forall b\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathrm{BVar}}\\;\\operatorname{val}_b(\\Psi_A)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Psi_A\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pfx}_B(\\langle(Q_i^A,p_i)\\rangle_{i&lt;n},\\phi_A),\\qquad\\mathrm{QSAT}_{\\mathrm{CNF}}^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_q]\\mid\\forall b\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathrm{BVar}}\\;\\operatorname{val}_b(\\Psi_A)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition2.30，印刷页38、扫描页53，定义一般前束布尔公式的真值问题，矩阵并不限CNF。这里先给出其完整布尔语法和递归真值，删除未解释的“{0,1}满足公式”调用。Var(φ)为有限公式树中变量叶集合；每个递归调用取严格子树，结果存在唯一。</p>\n<p>关系结构版本是对原书 Example2.18（印刷页32、扫描页47）的SAT编码增加量词标记与数值序的本地显式扩张。Proposition10.2的下界证明（印刷页158、扫描页173）实际通过SAT归约产生CNF矩阵，并将新增见证变量置于末尾存在量词，因而支持该版本；未声称任意QBF可在不加变量的情况下直接改写为CNF。相反，标准等可满足CNF扩张须将见证变量置于原前缀之后。本条保留一般QSAT与具体结构版本两个不同接口。</p>\n<p>本次把原先仅称为“固定有效编码”的接口落实为可唯一解析的前缀比特串；变量编号采用长度自定界二进制码。矩阵、空合取／析取和量词前缀均有确定的语法构造。所用结构查询及其真值不变；本条不额外断言某种任意编码下的资源界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-standard-inputs","status":"resolved","id":"4563061cac782dab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-standard-inputs]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-const","status":"resolved","id":"b9525166bc5de094","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-bool-const]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"1dacc2eff0f3c359","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bool-const","status":"resolved","id":"b9525166bc5de094","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BVar}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}$，$p_i=p_j\\leftrightarrow i=j$；它们是互异布尔变量符号。$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ 取 [[29-df-bool-const]]。所有公式构造子具有不同语法标签。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"1dacc2eff0f3c359","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{bin}_{\\mathbb N}$ 取 [[29-df-turing-machine]] 的自然数二进制串函数。$\\mathtt{0},\\mathtt{1},\\mathtt{000},\\ldots,\\mathtt{111}$ 是所显示的有限比特串，不是自然数；$\\operatorname{code}_B$ 的标签长度均为三位。$\\langle\\psi\\rangle$ 仅为下式编码函数的别名。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-standard-inputs","status":"resolved","id":"4563061cac782dab","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_q=\\langle P^{(2)},N^{(2)},U^{(1)}\\rangle$，$A\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_q]$，$n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\geq2$；$[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$。$<^A$ 是 [[29-df-standard-inputs]] 的标准序，$e_A$ 是下式唯一确定的递增枚举。每个元素同时索引一个变量和一个子句；$U$ 标记全称变量，$P,N$ 标记子句中的正负出现。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{BVar}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p_i=p_j\\leftrightarrow i=j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b:\\mathrm{BVar}\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"p,q\\in\\mathrm{BVar}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"b[a/p]","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{BFml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QBF}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i,j,r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vert","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar\\chi\\in\\mathrm{BFml}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar q\\in(\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}\\times\\